shall count, when he writeth up the people, that this man was born there. Selah.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"As well the singers as the players on instruments shall be there: all my springs are in thee.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":517,"caller":"+","text":"87.1 for the sons: or, of the sons","reference":{"chapter":87,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_kjv/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_kjv/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_kjv/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}